{"video":"DvPuNYaLfDI","lines":[{"t":[0,4.1],"en":"I guess we should go."},{"t":[4.4,5.2],"en":"No, wait, wait."},{"t":[5.7,6.2],"en":"Oh, yeah, right."},{"t":[7.1,7.9],"en":"No, Monica."},{"t":[9.6,11.4],"en":"Monica, we have to fix this."},{"t":[11.7,12.7],"en":"There's nothing we can do."},{"t":[12.8,13.8],"en":"You erased the message."},{"t":[14.1,15.3],"en":"Yeah, well, unless we tell him."},{"t":[15.9,17.8],"en":"Look, if you're going to be totally rational about this,"},{"t":[17.8,18.7],"en":"I can't argue with you."},{"t":[19.4,19.8],"en":"All right?"},{"t":[21.3,21.6],"en":"Fine."},{"t":[21.7,22.6],"en":"If you want to tell him, tell him."},{"t":[22.7,24],"en":"I just, I don't want to be a part of it."},{"t":[25.7,27.4],"en":"Oh, maybe that's Emily calling back"},{"t":[27.4,28.5],"en":"to leave the exact same message."},{"t":[30.7,32.4],"en":"Hey, Ross, it's you."},{"t":[33.2,35.5],"en":"I just want you to remember this feeling."},{"t":[36.1,38.6],"en":"You are lucky to be alive."},{"t":[38.9,41.5],"en":"So live every day to the fullest."},{"t":[42.5,44.1],"en":"Love yourself, okay?"},{"t":[44.8,45.3],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[45.8,47.3],"en":"Oh, I'd also get stamps."},{"t":[47.5,47.6],"en":"Bye."},{"t":[49.4,50],"en":"Wow."},{"t":[50.6,51.9],"en":"Lay that message for Emily,"},{"t":[51.9,53],"en":"and this whole problem goes away."},{"t":[60,90],"en":"Transcription by CastingWords"}]}
